## Complete Exercise List

### Basics (1-10)
1. Hello World program
2. Declare and use variables
3. All primitive data types
4. Basic arithmetic operations
5. Take user input with Scanner
6. Type casting examples
7. Using constants (final keyword)
8. Different types of comments
9. All operators (arithmetic, logical, relational)
10. Scanner class usage

### Conditionals (11-25)
11. Basic if-else statement
12. Check if number is even or odd
